y', 'Spoils of the Hunt', 'Steadfast Paladin', 'Sudden Insight', 'Swamp', 'Swarming Goblins', 'Sylvan Shepherd', 'Targ Nar, Demon-Fang Gnoll', "Tasha's Hideous Laughter", 'Teleportation Circle', 'Temple of the Dragon Queen', 'The Blackstaff of Waterdeep', 'The Book of Exalted Deeds', 'The Book of Vile Darkness', 'The Deck of Many Things', 'The Tarrasque', "Thieves' Tools", 'Tiamat', 'Tiger-Tribe Hunter', 'Treasure Chest', 'Treasure Vault', 'Trelasarra, Moon Dancer', "Trickster's Talisman", 'Triumphant Adventurer', 'True Polymorph', 'Underdark Basilisk', 'Unexpected Windfall', 'Valor Singer', 'Vampire Spawn', 'Varis, Silverymoon Ranger', 'Veteran Dungeoneer', 'Volo, Guide to Monsters', 'Vorpal Sword', 'Wandering Troubadour', 'Warlock Class', 'Werewolf Pack Leader', 'Westgate Regent', 'White Dragon', 'Wight', 'Wild Shape', 'Wish', 'Wizard Class', "Wizard's Spellbook", 'Xanathar, Guild Kingpin', 'Xorn', 'You Come to a River', 'You Come to the Gnoll Camp', 'You Find Some Prisoners', 'You Find a Cursed Idol', "You Find the Villains' Lair", 'You Happen On a Glade', 'You Hear Something on Watch', 'You Meet in a Tavern', 'You See a Guard Approach', 'You See a Pair of Goblins', "You're Ambushed on the Road", 'Yuan-Ti Fang-Blade', 'Yuan-Ti Malison', 'Zalto, Fire Giant Duke', 'Zariel, Archduke of Avernus', 'Zombie Ogre']
